OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency crews called to Loch
OL,4,ALeven after sailplane crashes into
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmergency crews have been called to
OL,8,FLoch Leven after a microlight glider
OL,9,Fcrashed into the water.
OL,11,FPolice, ambulance, fire service and the
OL,12,Fcoastguard were called to the scene
OL,13,Fnear Kinross at about 11:00.
OL,15,FThe Scottish Gliding Centre, which is
OL,16,Fbased at Portmoak Airfield near the
OL,17,Floch, said a two-seater Perkoz aircraft
OL,18,Fhad "crashed whilst on a local training
OL,19,Fflight" but it was not clear what had
OL,20,Fcaused the crash.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
