OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency crews called to Loch
OL,4,ALeven after sailplane crashes into
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Air Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,8,F(AAIB) said it had launched an
OL,9,Finvestigation and sent a team of
OL,10,Finspectors to the accident site.
